<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="hero">
  <h1>Every student survey, reviewed. Every parent asked first.</h1>
  <p class="lead">A single registry for the surveys your school gives students, a PPRA review for each one, and opt-in parent consent that is tracked down to each student.</p>
  <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup">Set up your school</a> <a class="btn" href="/login">Sign in</a></p>
</section>
<section class="grid3">
  <div class="card"><h2>Central survey registry</h2><p>Upload each instrument once. Flag the eight PPRA protected areas, record who funds it, and send it through a reviewer before it reaches students.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h2>Opt-in consent</h2><p>Each family gets a personal link. A student can participate only after a parent signs. If a parent never answers, the student does not take the survey.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h2>Parent inspection on request</h2><p>Families see a public list of your surveys and can ask to read one. Staff approve the request and the parent gets a secure link to the instrument.</p></div>
</section>
